  "notes": "Name at release Zephyr 141B-A35B, as in the model card until 2024-04-18 and in the handbook news; since that correction the card heading reads Zephyr 141B-A39B. The card says the model was trained collaboratively by Argilla, KAIST and Hugging Face; the co-developers are not listed in organizations because neither organisation is registered yet. Fine-tuned with ORPO from Mixtral 8x22B v0.1 (Mistral AI weights, Hub copy mistral-community/Mixtral-8x22B-v0.1); that cross-organisation relation is not recorded here."
